From b0fd19d7fd28dc2b1bbce8f09d4307575c3fb724 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 17:13:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(classifier): add 4-arm encoder ablation

Adds encoder_init (pretrained_frozen | pretrained_finetuned | random | none)
to isolate the value of GAAE reconstruction pretraining from the encoder
architecture and from the encoder itself, wired through GELSTMClassifier and
the GELSTM/GEC adapters. Defaults preserve today's exact behaviour.

Verification (tests, ruff, mypy) was skipped for this commit per explicit
request; CLASSIFIER/tests/test_encoder_arms.py and the CI checks in
.claude/rules/ci.md have not been (re-)run against the GEC changes above.
